# Frontend classification

You are working on the **FRONTEND** of SpaceForge.

## Boundaries
- Edit only under `frontend/` (especially `frontend/src/`), plus Vite/Tailwind config and `index.html`.
- Do **not** change `backend/` unless the user explicitly asks for API/backend work.
- Live cloud today: Firebase Auth + Django REST when `VITE_API_BASE_URL` is set (Track 2).
- AI / connectors / billing / events remain **stubs** until their API matrix rows ship.
- Never bypass `frontend/src/platform/` with ad-hoc `fetch` in feature components.

## Local test
- URL: http://localhost:3000
- Start: `npm run dev:frontend` (from repo root) or `cd frontend && npm run dev`
- Env: `frontend/.env` → `VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000`

## Important paths
| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| Routes | `frontend/src/App.tsx` |
| Pages | `frontend/src/pages/` |
| Data Agent | `frontend/src/components/data-agent/` |
| Platform façade | `frontend/src/platform/` |
| API wrappers | `frontend/src/services/api.ts` |
| Events UI | `frontend/src/features/events/` |

## Rule
Prefer client-side behavior and platform adapter changes. Backend REST lives in `backend/` — classify that as a separate task.
